"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n        <div class=\"shell\">\n          {{ppp:breadcrumbs}}\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Perth homes &amp; managed properties</span>\n          <h1>Fixture, Tap &amp; Appliance Connection Services in Perth</h1>\n<p>Book fixture, tap and appliance connection services in Perth for kitchen, bathroom and laundry work. Ellis Services Group assesses the existing plumbing and electrical connections, explains the installation requirements and provides a written quote. Our Perth team coordinates the relevant licensed trades for the agreed connection or repair scope.</p>\n        <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Book fixture and appliance connections</a></div>\n      </section>" as TrustedHtml,
