"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-editorial\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><nav class=\"service-jump-links\" aria-label=\"On this service page\"><a href=\"#service-work\">Services</a><a href=\"#service-method\">Repair &amp; installation</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Costs &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a><a href=\"#service-booking\">Book a visit</a></nav><aside class=\"service-answer\" data-service-answer><h2>What to do next</h2><p>Tell us the fixture or appliance, its intended location and whether you want a repair, replacement or new connection. Product details help, but you do not need to dismantle plumbing or electrical equipment to report the job safely. We assess mounting, access and the existing connections before agreeing the work. The quote separates product supply, connection work and any additional plumbing or electrical tasks. A purchased product is not automatically compatible with the property.</p><p><a href=\"insights-tenant-property-manager-maintenance-handover.html\">Prepare clear work and approval information</a>. <a href=\"contact.html?service=fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Request an assessment and written quote</a>.</p></aside><div id=\"service-work\" class=\"service-editorial-part\"><h2>Kitchen, bathroom and laundry installation services</h2><h3>Taps, sinks and bathroom fixtures</h3><p>We assess fitting dimensions, mounting arrangements and accessible connections before replacing or connecting a fixture. A new fitting must suit the existing installation as well as the intended use. For a fault at an existing tap rather than an installation request, our <a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">tap and mixer repairs</a> provide the more focused service.</p>\n<h3>Laundry and kitchen appliance connections</h3><p>Washing-machine and other appliance connection requests need the product specifications and existing connections considered. Tell us whether the appliance has already been supplied, where it will be installed and whether old equipment needs disconnection within the job. Water, drainage and electrical connection requirements are distinct items in the proposed scope. For outlet work, see <a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">power-point installation and repairs</a>.</p>\n<h3>Repairs around existing fixture connections</h3><p>Visible water under a sink or near a fixture needs the source assessed before parts are selected. We identify whether the request concerns an accessible connection, the fixture itself or another plumbing issue. For a leaking cistern or flush problem, use <a href=\"toilet-repairs-perth.html\">toilet repairs</a>; for temperature or hot-water supply faults, see <a href=\"hot-water-problems-perth.html\">hot-water repairs</a>.</p><figure class=\"service-editorial-figure\"><img\n            class=\"service-editorial-image\"\n            src=\"fixtures-appliances-service.png\"\n            width=\"1672\"\n            height=\"941\"\n            alt=\"Ellis Services Group plumber repairing bathroom plumbing fixtures\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"fixtures-appliances-service-480.webp 480w, fixtures-appliances-service-800.webp 800w, fixtures-appliances-service-1200.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1000px) 50vw, 380px\"></figure></div>\n<div id=\"service-method\" class=\"service-editorial-part\"><h2>How fixture and appliance work is scoped and quoted</h2><p>We review the selected product, installation location, accessible services and the result you need. The assessment establishes compatibility and any change required to existing pipework or wiring. Send the product details if you have already purchased equipment; we explain any installation requirement before assuming that it can be connected directly.</p>\n<h3>Coordinate connections with the wider renovation</h3><p>Kitchen and bathroom work may need access planned around cabinetry, benchtops and other trades. We clarify what is ready for connection and what remains outside the agreed scope. Product supply, disconnection, installation and separate building work are identified rather than combined into an unclear package. This gives homeowners and property managers a usable basis for approval.</p>\n<p>For authorised work, our team completes the agreed connections and checks the relevant installation. We explain the completed scope and any additional issue found, including whether a separate appliance service is needed. Where electrical fittings or outlets also need work, see our <a href=\"electrical.html\">electrical repair and installation services</a> and include these requirements in your booking.</p></div><p class=\"service-trade-note\">Our Perth plumbing and electrical work is carried out by appropriately licensed trades. Licence details are available on request.</p><p class=\"service-safety\"><strong>Safety:</strong> Leave existing electrical covers and connections intact and do not approach a leak near electrical equipment. For immediate danger, Call 000.</p><!-- keyword-gap:start --><div class=\"keyword-gap-content\" data-keyword-gap><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"gap-dishwasher-installation\"><h2>Dishwasher installation enquiries in Perth</h2><p>For a dishwasher connection, tell us whether it is replacing an appliance in the same space or going into a new location. An existing cupboard opening does not establish that the water, drainage and electrical arrangements suit the new product. Share the model or installation sheet if available; you can enquire before buying.</p><p>The written scope should distinguish connection to suitable existing services from any new plumbing or fixed electrical work. Cabinetry alterations, product delivery, removing the old appliance and internal appliance repairs are not automatically part of a connection request. Confirm which tasks are accepted and who will handle any separate work.</p><ul><li>Product model and intended kitchen position.</li><li>Existing appliance or a new location, with any known access restriction.</li><li>Who supplies the product and whether removal or another trade needs coordination.</li></ul><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html#gap-power-point-installation\">Electrical outlet installation and compatibility</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Leaks at an existing tap or connection</a></li><li><a href=\"contact.html?service=fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Discuss a dishwasher connection and written scope</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"gap-toilet-installation\"><h2>Toilet installation or a cistern repair?</h2><p>A toilet installation enquiry concerns the complete fixture and its connections. A running cistern, a faulty flush mechanism or a leaking component may need a repair rather than a new suite. Water rising in the bowl belongs with drainage assessment, not an assumption that the toilet must be replaced.</p><p>Before purchasing a replacement, discuss its dimensions, the existing connection position and access to the room. Confirm the accepted installation scope, product supply, removal of the old fixture and any separate floor, wall or connection work. A product-only price does not include every task needed at the property.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"toilet-repairs-perth.html\">Toilet and cistern repair assessment</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Blocked toilet and drain-clearing scope</a></li><li><a href=\"contact.html?service=fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Ask about a proposed toilet replacement</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"learn-about-fixtures-appliances-perth\"><h2>Fixture and appliance connections Perth: symptoms and service choices</h2><h3>Laundry overflow as a washing machine empties</h3><p>The external waste connection or drainage may be restricted, but an appliance-related issue can also require attention. Report where water appears and whether other fixtures drain normally. Internal washing-machine repairs and plumbing connections are different scopes.</p><h3>Repairing leaking washing-machine supply taps</h3><p>Yes. We assess the supply tap or connection and agree the replacement or repair. A leaking supply tap is not a promise to repair internal appliance parts.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Drainage symptoms and clearing scope</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"keyword-gap-part\" id=\"confirmed-supply-removal\"><h2>Supply, removal and taking away the old unit</h2><p>For dishwasher and toilet installations, we can supply the agreed product, remove the old unit and take it away as part of the installation package. The written quote identifies the selected product, connection work and any additional access or making good. Cabinet changes, bathroom renovation and internal appliance repairs are not automatically included.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"dishwasher-installation-perth.html\">Dishwasher supply and installation</a></li><li><a href=\"toilet-installation-perth.html\">Toilet supply and installation</a></li></ul></div></div><!-- keyword-gap:end --></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
